F2022L01563:7 a legcons:Item,
        owl:Class,
        dcat:Resource ;
    rdfs:label """Item - I7 Calculation of operational risk regulatory capital
An ADI must calculate its operational risk capital charge as 12 per cent of its business indicator BI plus
if the BI exceeds 15 billion then 3 per cent of the amount by which the BI exceeds 15 billion plus
if the BI exceeds 45 billion then 3 per cent of the amount by which the BI exceeds 45 billion
Calculation of the business indicator"""@en-AU ;
    dct:isReferencedBy F2022L01563: ;
    rdfs:comment """Calculation of operational risk regulatory capital
An ADI must calculate its operational risk capital charge as 12 per cent of its business indicator BI plus
if the BI exceeds 15 billion then 3 per cent of the amount by which the BI exceeds 15 billion plus
if the BI exceeds 45 billion then 3 per cent of the amount by which the BI exceeds 45 billion
Calculation of the business indicator - Abrievated Graph Key: I7"""@en-AU ;
    skos:definition """Calculation of operational risk regulatory capital
